# 📚 Key Learnings

- Customer understanding is more important than building more features.
- Focus on solving one major problem exceptionally well.
- Build an MVP before investing in advanced functionality.
- Product-Market Fit is achieved through continuous customer feedback.
- Prioritize features based on user value, not assumptions.

